# Byte-identical publication artifacts: the SHA256SUMS manifests hash the
# files exactly as the sweep wrote them (CRLF on the Windows runner). Git
# must never normalize these blobs, or a fresh checkout cannot verify them
# (external review 2026-10-01). When this attribute is first committed,
# re-add the pack so the stored bytes match the manifests:
#   git add benchmark/published/
benchmark/published/** -text
